          "content": "**3.** Diagonals AC and BD of a trapezium ABCD with AB || DC intersect each other at the point O. Using a similarity criterion for two triangles, show that $\\frac { \\mathrm { O A } } { \\mathrm { O C } }   =   \\frac { \\mathrm { O B } } { \\mathrm { O D } }$"
